	(text "Resistor-only personality ID board. Host pulls J5-7 low, then J5-8 low, and reads J5-4 (R62 100k to 3V3, C68 100n to GND). R41 sets the J5-7 reading, R42 sets the J5-8 reading. R59 (4k7) pulls J5-5 to 3V3 as on the original board. J5-3 and J5-6 are contact pads only. Footprints are assumed from photos, verify before ordering."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100.33 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
